You really wait if something happens
to me, before you eat that pomegranate?


00:49:22.920 --> 00:49:24.752
Here, wash it down.


00:49:29.400 --> 00:49:34.839
Fruit for breakfast is healthy.
Yummy. Bewitched fruit with alcohol.


00:50:11.120 --> 00:50:15.399
You know what?
We'll never get to that damn village.


00:50:15.520 --> 00:50:18.115
- Bullshit.
- This island is a labyrinth.


00:50:20.000 --> 00:50:22.117
- A trap.
- Stop talking nonsense.


00:50:22.240 --> 00:50:25.517
- Who's telling the truth?
- Not you.


00:50:25.640 --> 00:50:27.074
Children and drunks.


00:50:31.320 --> 00:50:33.630
We're going to die here tonight, anyway.


00:50:33.760 --> 00:50:37.913
Tonight some kind of sea monsters,
Cyclops


00:50:38.040 --> 00:50:41.192
or fucking Greek gods
are going to get us for sure.


00:50:45.840 --> 00:50:47.194
But you know what?


00:50:49.640 --> 00:50:50.960
I'm ready.


00:50:52.960 --> 00:50:55.794
See, Poseidon already has the hots for me.


00:50:55.920 --> 00:50:59.277
Hey Poseidon, I brought you
a lover from Germany.


00:51:04.440 --> 00:51:07.399
- And now?
- Fuck off, man.


00:51:10.440 --> 00:51:13.717
- Say "fuck off" again.
- Fuck off.


00:54:02.480 --> 00:54:06.952
- Get up, now. Our flight is leaving soon.
- Why are you yelling, man?


00:54:08.280 --> 00:54:11.637
Come on, the hotel is just ahead.
I can see it from here.


00:54:29.400 --> 00:54:31.437
All that stress for nothing at all.


00:54:32.960 --> 00:54:35.794
Now we're just hanging around
in this hotel room.


00:54:38.520 --> 00:54:43.072
- What's up?
- Nothing. I'm reading.


00:54:45.080 --> 00:54:49.711
- Aren't you talking to me anymore?
- I'm tired and want to go home.


00:54:56.320 --> 00:54:58.312
Come on, let's go to the airport.


00:55:00.800 --> 00:55:03.269
- Dude, we still have tons of time.
- And?


00:55:03.400 --> 00:55:06.074
I don't feel like hanging around here
anymore.


00:55:28.720 --> 00:55:30.552
I'll go sit down over there.


00:55:53.440 --> 00:55:56.911
BERLIN-SCHÖNEFELD AIRPORT


00:56:02.000 --> 00:56:05.755
- There's the bus.
- I'm taking the X7.


00:56:07.120 --> 00:56:09.635
- Why that one?
- I'll give you a call.


00:58:40.560 --> 00:58:44.110
Can you tell me the last time
my buddy was here?


00:58:44.240 --> 00:58:48.314
- The blonde pretty boy?
- Yeah, yeah. The blonde pretty boy.


00:58:55.160 --> 00:58:56.480
Oh, okay.


00:58:57.560 --> 00:59:01.600
- I see that he cancelled.
- He cancelled his membership?


00:59:01.720 --> 00:59:02.870
Yeah.


00:59:05.280 --> 00:59:08.591
- Okay, thanks.
- Just call him.


00:59:24.560 --> 00:59:26.677
Hey, what are you doing here?


00:59:29.880 --> 00:59:31.200
I was waiting for you.


00:59:33.080 --> 00:59:34.196
Okay.


00:59:36.080 --> 00:59:39.198
You're not coming to the gym anymore?


00:59:39.320 --> 00:59:43.473
I have too much to do at school.
I don't have enough time for the gym.


00:59:45.840 --> 00:59:49.231
And to see me? You don't have
enough time for that either?


00:59:52.880 --> 00:59:54.280
Not right now, no.


00:59:55.400 --> 00:59:57.835
What happened with your supplements store?


01:00:00.240 --> 01:00:02.914
Well, I couldn't find anyone
to handle the sales.


01:00:03.040 --> 01:00:05.157
Well, I've got to go now.


01:00:06.200 --> 01:00:07.953
- Go where?
- To the university.


01:01:00.640 --> 01:01:02.154
DELETE PHOTO


01:01:41.040 --> 01:01:44.158
- Your mobile is ringing.
- Never mind.


01:01:45.720 --> 01:01:49.350
Aren't I allowed to know who it is?
Do you have a new lover?


01:01:49.480 --> 01:01:51.711
I'm afraid I'll have to disappoint you.


01:01:53.800 --> 01:01:54.916
Hey, that's Philipp.


01:01:57.760 --> 01:02:00.878
- I'll call back later.
- You can talk to him now.


01:02:02.560 --> 01:02:05.598
- Not now.
- Why not?


01:02:05.720 --> 01:02:06.710
Just because.


01:02:16.200 --> 01:02:18.669
Why didn't you invite Philipp
to the party?


01:02:19.720 --> 01:02:23.680
- Why should I?
- I thought you were friends?


01:02:24.960 --> 01:02:28.271
- No. He wouldn't have fit in.
- Oh, come on.


01:02:28.400 --> 01:02:33.953
He would have fit right in.
My gay friends would have found him sweet.


01:02:34.080 --> 01:02:36.276
Of course that is a reason.


01:02:36.400 --> 01:02:39.472
You know, I would find it sweet,
if you had a thing with Philipp.


01:02:39.600 --> 01:02:44.072
Yeah, I know.
But I'm not doing you that favor.


01:02:44.200 --> 01:02:49.594
I would enjoy watching you two make out.
I'm sure he's a good kisser.


01:02:49.720 --> 01:02:51.279
Stop now.


01:02:51.400 --> 01:02:56.316
- Why are you so serious? I'm just kidding.
- I'm tired and I want to go home.


01:03:42.760 --> 01:03:43.796
What's up?


01:03:47.920 --> 01:03:50.310
- Come to the park for a minute.


01:03:50.440 --> 01:03:53.319
Man, right now is a bad time.
I have so much to do for school.


01:03:55.480 --> 01:03:56.311
Please.


01:04:00.360 --> 01:04:01.316
Okay.


01:04:02.760 --> 01:04:04.035
But just for a minute.


01:04:22.240 --> 01:04:23.469
What's up?


01:04:26.520 --> 01:04:28.273
I wanted to say goodbye to you.


01:04:32.400 --> 01:04:33.356
What?


01:04:36.480 --> 01:04:37.800
I'm leaving Berlin.


01:04:43.360 --> 01:04:44.271
Okay.


01:04:45.640 --> 01:04:46.869
Where are you going?


01:04:48.120 --> 01:04:51.557
To Greece.
I'm starting to work in a hotel.


01:04:55.560 --> 01:04:56.755
For how long?


01:04:58.680 --> 01:05:02.071
I don't know how long it will take
until I've forgotten...


01:05:03.920 --> 01:05:06.515
- Come on, you're just kidding.
- No.


01:05:06.640 --> 01:05:09.200
Here. My flight is leaving soon.


01:05:29.840 --> 01:05:31.035
Ticket.


01:07:14.680 --> 01:07:16.478
You're not serious, are you?


01:07:20.120 --> 01:07:21.031
Yes.


01:07:24.040 --> 01:07:28.432
- And I'm sorry.
- You don't have to be sorry.


01:07:32.120 --> 01:07:34.316
And you're going to drop everything?


01:07:37.000 --> 01:07:38.434
I'm not sure myself.


01:07:41.000 --> 01:07:44.391
- And what about your studies?
- Taking a break?


01:07:46.720 --> 01:07:48.473
I'll think about that later.


01:07:52.240 --> 01:07:54.516
Life is full of bad jokes, Enis.


01:07:56.680 --> 01:07:58.273
Ever noticed that?


01:08:02.280 --> 01:08:03.270
Nope.


01:08:05.240 --> 01:08:06.310
Where is Philipp?


01:08:08.280 --> 01:08:10.636
He's probably waiting for you somewhere.


01:08:14.520 --> 01:08:15.431
Okay.


01:08:18.920 --> 01:08:19.831
Kristina?


01:08:22.880 --> 01:08:24.872
I would like to say goodbye to you.

